🔹 Example Use Case
Imagine you have a Dockerized Go application.
Go Application
      ↓
Docker Image
      ↓
Amazon ECR
      ↓
ECS Task Definition
      ↓
ECS Service
      ↓
AWS Fargate
      ↓
Application Load Balancer
      ↓
Users

Suppose you want 3 replicas:
ECS Service
     │
     ├── Fargate Task 1
     ├── Fargate Task 2
     └── Fargate Task 3

